                "retweet_count": 52,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Sacramento\u2019s regulatory failures have driven insurers out of California, leaving families with fewer choices and skyrocketing premiums. This crisis is a direct result of the state\u2019s broken policies. Our insurance rates (if you can get one) are 3-5 times higher than they were just three years ago.\n\nWe need real leadership, less regulation, and more competition to protect homeowners and fix the mess Sacramento created.\n\nhttps://t.co/UfpwLW6X4I",
